Algs4 Attribution
================

This folder contains classes from the Algs4 library by Robert Sedgewick and Kevin Wayne
of Princeton University.

Website: https://algs4.cs.princeton.edu/
Source Code: https://algs4.cs.princeton.edu/code/
License: https://algs4.cs.princeton.edu/faq/

These files are used in example programs and are included with proper attribution
to the original authors. Please refer to the official Algs4 license for terms and
conditions of use.
